# submitted for the Freedom With AI Batch 10 build project. Answers come
# from the clinic file; anything else becomes a staff ticket. The model
# key stays on the server.
#
# Version 1.1.0.0 adds, beside the baseline and without changing what it does:
# a reply and a ticket when a patient asks for a person, with a seventh quick
# reply; search, status filter, sort and opt-in urgent alerts on the staff
# page; a form for the clinic file that writes into the same JSON box; an
# optional assistant name and the clinic's own quick replies in the file.
#
# Version 1.2.0.0 (22 November 2026, evening) adds to the staff page: the queue
# at a glance, CSV export, ready-made replies, a filter by ticket type and a
# private staff note; and a booking reply that states the named day's hours.
#
# Version 1.3.0.0 (22 November 2026, late evening) adds ticket numbers, the
# patient's chat thread inside a ticket, feedback on a reply, and tickets shared
# across devices through a server store (a private key per browser, a desk code
# for staff).
